# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# The rendered fieldbook belongs beside the GIN export in the external data folder,
# never here: it is derived data, it stays a personnel record after redaction, and
# anything under docs/ would be rendered onto the public website by Quarto.
# build_fieldbook_md.py refuses to write inside the repo; this catches a hand copy.
CH-LAE_fieldbook*.md
CH-LAE-laegeren-export_*.csv
redact_*.csv
redact_*.txt
